Z||000004||Oreif||04-16-2001||06:43 PM||||That is very bad for the baby. At 2 1/2 months their bones and joints are still soft. She can damage the knees and hips, Especially if she is swinging the baby. Also the muscle's are not developed enough for that. The other problem is the skull seams are still soft too. Swinging upside down can put undo pressure on the skull and cause other problems. Ask any doctor about it. <BR>||||reg||1
